WEBVTT

00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:14.233
Bottom line: use Agent 365 as the control plane for one accountable pilot; verify ownership, access, action traces, licenses, and preview limits before scaling.

00:00:14.767 --> 00:00:18.633
Agent 365 is the control plane for AI agents.

00:00:18.633 --> 00:00:27.200
Ask who owns each one, where it runs, what it can reach, who it affects, and what risk needs action.

00:00:27.767 --> 00:00:31.733
Observe with a registry, activity, and health first.

00:00:31.733 --> 00:00:39.767
Add telemetry so each request, model step, tool call, and error has a trace for operators, not guesswork.

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:43.167
Govern and secure access as one path.

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:52.267
Pair lifecycle review, Entra controls, Purview data checks, and Defender signals for every agent before wider rollout.

00:00:52.833 --> 00:00:57.200
Keep the current agent and add only needed SDK pieces.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:05.500
Pilot one owned use case, verify licenses and preview limits, then scale only from evidence and review.
